WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.900
Meet Olanga. A little help, right where you work.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.640
Play Spotify, set the volume to seventy-five
percent, and keep going.

3
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:14.060
Everyday controls stay close, with an orb you can
call on from your desktop.

4
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:24.550
Coming next: follow the Warriors without leaving
your work. Live scores stay nearby during a game.

5
00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:27.230
Tuck them away, or bring them inside Olanga.

6
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:36.990
Conversations carry context forward. Olanga can pick
up useful preferences, recall them later,

7
00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:41.370
and use those details when they matter. See what it
remembers, and forget anything.

8
00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:50.360
Turn a familiar start into a routine. Choose your
apps, tasks, and focus timer once.

9
00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:55.480
Then ask Olanga to run it, review it, and watch your
session begin.

10
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.830
Need a second pair of eyes? Show Olanga what you're
working on.

11
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.520
Choose the allowed area,

12
00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.300
then review its proposed steps before approving an
edit.

13
00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:19.430
Find the right file. Preview a clearer set of names,
apply the changes,

14
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:23.990
and undo them when you need to.

15
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:28.100
Capture an idea in Notepad.

16
00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:31.970
Keep the next step in your checklist.

17
00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:38.570
Catch up with News. Each has its own place, without
breaking the conversation.

18
00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.830
Open a saved workspace.

19
00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:48.860
Ask about a project, and follow the answer back to
the selected files it came from.

20
00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:53.370
Make it feel like yours. Check for updates when
you're ready.

21
00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.690
Olanga. More done. Stay in your flow.
